" title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-5 eWNgYd\">7</div></a><a aria-label=\"105018 8-star reviews. Select to read them.\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/reviews/?rating=8&amp;ref_=tt_ururv_genai_histo_8\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-2 iJQtGs histogram-bar-clickable\" data-testid=\"rating-histogram-bar-8\"><div data-testid=\"histogram-bar-container\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-3 kKZqEc\"><div data-testid=\"histogram-bar\" style=\"height:88.47197182861282%\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-0 dbITeh\"><div title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-4 kQNZgU\"></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"histogram-label\" aria-hidden=\"false\" title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-5 eWNgYd\">8</div></a><a aria-label=\"113049 9-star reviews. Select to read them.\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/reviews/?rating=9&amp;ref_=tt_ururv_genai_histo_9\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-2 iJQtGs histogram-bar-clickable\" data-testid=\"rating-histogram-bar-9\"><div data-testid=\"histogram-bar-container\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-3 kKZqEc\"><div data-testid=\"histogram-bar\" style=\"height:95.23765395696788%\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-0 dbITeh\"><div title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-4 kQNZgU\"></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"histogram-label\" aria-hidden=\"false\" title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-5 eWNgYd\">9</div></a><a aria-label=\"118702 10-star reviews. Select to read them.\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/reviews/?rating=10&amp;ref_=tt_ururv_genai_histo_10\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-2 iJQtGs histogram-bar-clickable\" data-testid=\"rating-histogram-bar-10\"><div data-testid=\"histogram-bar-container\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-3 kKZqEc\"><div data-testid=\"histogram-bar\" style=\"height:100%\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-0 dbITeh\"><div title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-4 kQNZgU\"></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"histogram-label\" aria-hidden=\"false\" title=\"\" class=\"sc-7ebf4bfc-5 eWNgYd\">10</div></a></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"ai-review-summary\"><div class=\"ipc-title ipc-title--base ipc-title--title ipc-title--on-textPrimary\"><hgroup><h3 class=\"ipc-title__text\">Summary</h3></hgroup></div><div class=\"AIReviewSummary_container__grmY3\" data-testid=\"ai-review-summary-text\"><div class=\"ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base\" role=\"presentation\"><div class=\"ipc-html-content-inner-div\" role=\"presentation\">Reviewers say &#39;Brooklyn Nine-Nine&#39; is acclaimed for its humor, ensemble cast, and character growth, especially in early seasons. The show is lauded for its diversity and handling of social issues with a light touch. However, some critics feel later seasons, particularly the final one, became too political and lost comedic charm, shifting focus from entertainment to social commentary. Despite this, &#39;Brooklyn Nine-Nine&#39; remains a standout sitcom with memorable moments and a loyal fanbase.</div></div><span class=\"AIReviewSummary_disclaimer__CCUVJ\">AI-generated from the text of user reviews</span></div><div class=\"AIReviewSummary_container__grmY3\"><div class=\"ipc-chip-list--base ipc-chip-list ipc-chip-list--wrap\" data-testid=\"themes-chip-list\"><div class=\"ipc-chip-list__arrow ipc-chip-list__arrow--left\" role=\"presentation\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"ipc-icon ipc-icon--chevron-left-inline ipc-icon--inline\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" role=\"presentation\"><path d=\"M18.378 23.369c.398-.402.622-.947.622-1.516 0-.568-.224-1.113-.622-1.515l-8.249-8.34 8.25-8.34a2.16 2.16 0 0 0 .548-2.07A2.132 2.132 0 0 0 17.428.073a2.104 2.104 0 0 0-2.048.555l-9.758 9.866A2.153 2.153 0 0 0 5 12.009c0 .568.224 1.114.622 1.515l9.758 9.866c.808.817 2.17.817 2.998-.021z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"ipc-chip-list__scroller\"><button class=\"AIThemesChipList_theme_chip__5zcDG ipc-chip ipc-chip--on-base\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Binge-worthy positive sentiment\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-testid=\"theme-chip-binge-worthy\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"ipc-icon ipc-icon--theme-positive ipc-icon--inline ipc-chip