t;NINE NINE!&quot; on set to help motivate other cast members. The writers liked this very much so they decided to add it into the series.</div></div></span></span></div></div></div><a class=\"ipc-metadata-list-item__icon-link\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"See more\" aria-disabled=\"false\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/trivia/?ref_=tt_dyk_trv\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"ipc-icon ipc-icon--chevron-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" role=\"presentation\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0V0z\"></path><path d=\"M9.29 6.71a.996.996 0 0 0 0 1.41L13.17 12l-3.88 3.88a.996.996 0 1 0 1.41 1.41l4.59-4.59a.996.996 0 0 0 0-1.41L10.7 6.7c-.38-.38-1.02-.38-1.41.01z\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"ipc-list-card--border-line ipc-list-card--tp-none ipc-list-card--bp-none ipc-list-card--base ipc-list-card sc-6cb374f1-1 dgAxbQ\"><ul class=\"ipc-metadata-list ipc-metadata-list--dividers-none ipc-metadata-list--base\" role=\"presentation\"><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"ipc-metadata-list__item ipc-metadata-list__item--align-end ipc-metadata-list__item--stacked ipc-metadata-list-item--link\"><a class=\"ipc-metadata-list-item__label ipc-metadata-list-item__label--link\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"See more\" aria-disabled=\"false\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/goofs/?tab=gf&amp;ref_=tt_dyk_gf\">Goofs</a><div class=\"ipc-metadata-list-item__content-container\"><div class=\"ipc-overflowText ipc-overflowText--listCard ipc-overflowText--height-short ipc-overflowText--short ipc-overflowText--click ipc-overflowText--base\"><button class=\"ipc-overflowText-overlay\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"See more\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"ipc-icon ipc-icon--more-horiz ipc-overflowText-overlay__affordance\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" role=\"presentation\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0V0z\"></path><path d=\"M6 10c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2s.9 2 2 2 2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2zm12 0c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2s.9 2 2 2 2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2zm-6 0c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2s.9 2 2 2 2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"ipc-overflowText--children\"><span lang=\"en-US\" class=\"duration-200\"><span><div class=\"ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base ipc-html-content--display-inline\" role=\"presentation\"><div class=\"ipc-html-content-inner-div\" role=\"presentation\">Holt carries a revolver rather than a semiautomatic like Jake, Rosa, Amy, Charles and Terry do because the NYPD allowed any officer who purchased a revolver prior to the department&#39;s switchover to semiautomatics in 1994--such as Holt, who had been with the department since the 1970s--to keep them.</div></div></span></span></div></div></div><a class=\"ipc-metadata-list-item__icon-link\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"See more\" aria-disabled=\"false\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/goofs/?tab=gf&amp;ref_=tt_dyk_gf\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"ipc-icon ipc-icon--chevron-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" role=\"presentation\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0V0z\"></path><path d=\"M9.29 6.71a.996.996 0 0 0 0 1.41L13.17 12l-3.88 3.88a.996.996 0 1 0 1.41 1.41l4.59-4.59a.996.996 0 0 0 0-1.41L10.7 6.7c-.38-.38-1.02-.38-1.41.01z\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"ipc-list-card--border-line ipc-list-card--tp-none ipc-list-card--bp-none ipc-list-card--base ipc-list-card sc-6cb374f1-1 dgAxbQ\"><ul class=\"ipc-metadata-list ipc-metadata-list--dividers-none ipc-metadata-list--base\" role=\"presentation\"><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"ipc-metadata-list__item ipc-metadata-list__item--align-end ipc-metadata-list__item--stacked ipc-metadata-list-item--link\" data-testid=\"didyouknow-quote\"><a class=\"ipc-metadata-list-item__label ipc-metadata-list-item__label--link\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"See more\" aria-disabled=\"false\" href=\"/title/tt2467372/quotes/?ref_=tt_dyk_qu\">Quotes</a><div cla